		{ f="11106-d352a290", h="d352a290", t="Once the greatest gold production center in the human lands, the Dead Mines are now inhabited by the Defias Brotherhood, who have turned the dark tunnels into their private sanctum. It is rumored that the thieves have conscripted the clever goblins to help them build something terrible at the bottom of the mines - but what that may be is still uncertain. Rumor has it that the way into the Deadmines lies through the quiet, unassuming village of Moonbrook. ", d=31.630 },
		{ f="11106-e013de07", h="e013de07", t="As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here.", d=5.000 },
